L["this client would not say who received it, and the macro aimed at nobody"] = "此客户端不告诉我们是谁接收了它，宏也没有瞄准任何人"
L["the shout went out, but they were too far away to hear it"] = "怒吼已发出，但对方离得太远，没听到"
L["the shout went out, but nothing could tell whether they were close enough to hear it"] = "怒吼已发出，但无法判断对方是否近到能听到"
L["|cffffd100%s counted as repaid|r -- %s."] = "|cffffd100%s的人情算作已还|r——%s。"
L["|cffffd100%s counted as repaid after all|r -- the error before it was about something else."] = "|cffffd100%s的人情最终还是算作已还|r——之前的错误与此无关。"
L["|cffffd100the spell for %s went out after all|r -- the error before it was about something else."] = "|cffffd100给%s的法术最终还是施放了|r——之前的错误与此无关。"
L["|cffffd100%s was buffed after all|r -- the error before it was about something else."] = "|cffffd100最终还是给%s加上了增益|r——之前的错误与此无关。"
L["the game refused the cast after sending it"] = "游戏在发出施法后又拒绝了它"
L["CAST SENT %s -> %s"] = "施法已发送 %s -> %s"
L["|cff00ff00CAST OK|r %s"] = "|cff00ff00施法成功|r %s"
L["the game refused the cast"] = "游戏拒绝了这次施法"
L["|cffff8080could not cast|r %s"] = "|cffff8080无法施放|r%s"
L["|cffff4040after our cast:|r %s"] = "|cffff4040施法后：|r%s"
L["cannot touch macros in combat."] = "战斗中无法修改宏。"
L["macro |cffffd100%s|r updated. Drag it onto a bar."] = "宏|cffffd100%s|r已更新。把它拖到动作条上。"
L["|cffff8080no free macro slots.|r Delete one and try again."] = "|cffff8080没有空闲的宏位置。|r删除一个后再试。"
L["macro |cffffd100%s|r created. Drag it onto a bar from the macro window."] = "宏|cffffd100%s|r已创建。从宏界面把它拖到动作条上。"
