L["your |cffffd100%s|r macro was updated -- the one an older version made no longer pressed the prompt."] = "你的|cffffd100%s|r宏已更新——旧版本创建的宏已无法触发提示框。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- you are in a fight."] = "你自己的增益：暂不推荐——你正在战斗中。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- skipped for now."] = "你自己的增益：暂不推荐——已暂时跳过。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- the game will not say your name."] = "你自己的增益：暂不推荐——游戏无法告知你的名字。"
L["%s: %s is running low -- a top-up is due."] = "%s：%s快到期了——该补加了。"
L["%s: none up -- %s is the one to cast."] = "%s：一个都不在身上——该施放%s。"
L["%s: switched off (Don't remind me)."] = "%s：已关闭（“不提醒我”）。"
L["%s: %s is up."] = "%s：已有%s。"
L["%s: Automatic, and your group role is not tank, so it is not offered."] = "%s：“自动”，而你的队伍职责不是坦克，所以不推荐。"
