L["%s: the game says %s cannot be cast right now."] = "%s：游戏提示%s现在无法施放。"
L["%s: Automatic has nothing it would pick."] = "%s：“自动”没有可选的法术。"
L["%s: the game will not say whether it is up, so it is not offered."] = "%s：游戏无法告知你身上是否有它，所以不推荐。"
L["your own buffs: held back -- you are in a city or an inn, and %s is off."] = "你自己的增益：暂不推荐——你在城市或旅店中，而%s已关闭。"
L["Also in cities and inns"] = "也在城市和旅店中"
L["your own %s comes first -- the buffs below wait until it has been cast."] = "你自己的%s优先——下面这些增益要等它施放后才推荐。"
L["this class has no buffs to cast on other players."] = "此职业没有可以给其他玩家加的增益。"
L["|cffff8080not during a fight|r -- the prompt cannot be put on screen while one is on. Try again when it ends."] = "|cffff8080战斗中不行|r——战斗中无法把提示框放到屏幕上。战斗结束后再试。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r is installed, but this class has no buffs to cast on other players."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r已安装，但此职业没有可以给其他玩家加的增益。"
L["It is still worth keeping for an alt that does -- it will say hello again there."] = "不过仍值得为有增益的小号保留它——到时它会在那边再打一次招呼。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r is installed, but nothing will be offered to anybody: %s."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r已安装，但不会向任何人推荐任何增益：%s。"
L["|cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings the rest of this back once that changes."] = "情况改变后，输入|cffffd100/manners welcome|r可再次查看其余说明。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts your own buffs on a small prompt when none of them is up -- your class has none for other players. Clicking the prompt casts it on you."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会在你自己的增益一个都不在身上时，把它们放到一个小提示框上——你的职业没有可以给其他玩家加的增益。点击提示框即可对你自己施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts your own buffs on a small prompt when none of them is up; nothing is offered to anybody else: %s. Clicking the prompt casts it on you."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会在你自己的增益一个都不在身上时，把它们放到一个小提示框上；不会给其他任何人推荐增益：%s。点击提示框即可对你自己施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody in your group who is missing your |cffffd100%s|r -- or who has just buffed you -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt casts it."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会把队伍中缺少你的|cffffd100%s|r的人（或刚给你加过增益的人）放到一个小提示框上。点击提示框即可施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody in your group who is missing your |cffffd100buff|r -- or who has just buffed you -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt casts it."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会把队伍中缺少你的|cffffd100增益|r的人（或刚给你加过增益的人）放到一个小提示框上。点击提示框即可施放。"
L["|cffffd100Manners|r puts anybody who buffs you -- and any stranger nearby who is missing one of yours -- on a small prompt. Clicking the prompt buffs them."] = "|cffffd100Manners|r会把给你加增益的人（以及附近缺少你某个增益的陌生人）放到一个小提示框上。点击提示框即可给对方加增益。"
L["The one thing that is not automatic: |cffffd100/manners macro|r or |cffffd100Make a macro|r in the options makes a macro for your bars, or bind a key under Options > Keybindings > Manners."] = "唯一不能自动完成的一步：输入|cffffd100/manners macro|r或点击选项中的|cffffd100创建宏|r，为动作条创建一个宏；或在选项 > 快捷键 > Manners中绑定快捷键。"
L["|cffff8080It is switched off on this profile|r, so no prompt will appear -- |cffffd100/manners on|r when you want it."] = "|cffff8080此配置文件已将其关闭|r，因此不会出现提示框——需要时输入|cffffd100/manners on|r。"
L["The prompt is on screen now, with somebody real on it already. |cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings this back."] = "提示框已经在屏幕上了，上面已有一位真实的玩家。输入|cffffd100/manners welcome|r可再次查看这段说明。"
L["That is the prompt, with a pretend name on it. |cffffd100/manners welcome|r brings this back."] = "这就是提示框，上面是一个虚构的名字。输入|cffffd100/manners welcome|r可再次查看这段说明。"
L["does not exist (or its existence is withheld)"] = "不存在（或其存在被隐藏）"
L["withheld: %s"] = "被隐藏：%s"
L["this buff is not readable here"] = "此处无法读取该增益"
L["%s has no unit token right now, so {unit} cannot be filled"] = "%s目前没有单位标识，因此无法填入{unit}"
L["1 minute"] = "1分钟"
L["%d minutes"] = "%d分钟"
L["snoozed for %s, until %s -- though Manners is switched off, so no prompt appears either way."] = "已开启免打扰%s，至%s——不过Manners已关闭，所以无论如何都不会出现提示框。"
L["snoozed for %s, until %s. In a fight the prompt stays as the fight found it, and follows the snooze once this one ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已开启免打扰%s，至%s。战斗中提示框保持战斗开始时的样子，本场战斗结束后再进入免打扰。输入|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r可提前结束。"
L["snoozed for %s, until %s. The prompt is unlocked, so it stays up to be dragged and casts nothing; once you lock it, it stays away until the snooze ends. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已开启免打扰%s，至%s。提示框已解锁，所以会留在屏幕上供你拖动，但不会施法；锁定后，它会一直隐藏到免打扰结束。输入|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r可提前结束。"
L["snoozed for %s -- no prompt until %s. |cffffd100/manners snooze off|r ends it early."] = "已开启免打扰%s——%s之前不显示提示框。输入|cffffd100/manners snooze off|r可提前结束。"
L["the snooze is over, but Manners is switched off -- |cffffd100/manners on|r to see the prompt again."] = "免打扰已结束，但Manners已关闭——输入|cffffd100/manners on|r可重新显示提示框。"
L["the snooze is over -- the prompt can appear again once this fight ends."] = "免打扰已结束——本场战斗结束后提示框可以再次出现。"
L["the snooze is over -- the prompt can appear again."] = "免打扰已结束——提示框可以再次出现。"
L["not snoozed -- the prompt is free to appear."] = "未开启免打扰——提示框可以正常出现。"
L["there is nothing to import -- paste a settings string that starts with MNR1:."] = "没有可导入的内容——请粘贴以MNR1:开头的设置字符串。"
L["that is not a Manners settings string -- one starts with MNR1:."] = "这不是Manners的设置字符串——设置字符串以MNR1:开头。"
L["that is far longer than any Manners settings string, so it was not read."] = "这比任何Manners设置字符串都长得多，因此没有读取。"
L["that string was made by a newer version of Manners -- update the addon to read it."] = "该字符串由更新版本的Manners生成——请更新插件后再读取。"
L["that string is incomplete or has been changed -- copy it again in one piece, and paste a long one into the box under Share as text on the Profiles tab of the options."] = "该字符串不完整或已被改动——请重新完整复制；较长的字符串请粘贴到选项“配置文件”标签页“以文本分享”下的文本框中。"
L["that string is damaged -- part of it is not a setting Manners can read. Copy it again in one piece."] = "该字符串已损坏——其中一部分不是Manners能读取的设置。请重新完整复制。"
L["that string gives %s a value it cannot have, so nothing was changed."] = "该字符串给%s设置了一个不可能的值，因此没有做任何更改。"
L["settings imported -- every one of them is the default."] = "设置已导入——全部都是默认值。"
L["settings imported -- 1 differs from the defaults."] = "设置已导入——有1项与默认值不同。"
L["settings imported -- %d differ from the defaults."] = "设置已导入——有%d项与默认值不同。"
L["1 setting from a newer version of Manners was left out."] = "有1项来自更新版本Manners的设置被略过。"
L["%d settings from a newer version of Manners were left out."] = "有%d项来自更新版本Manners的设置被略过。"
L["The string had speaking a line when you buff switched on. That is left off, because it talks to other players: switch it on under What I say if you want it."] = "该字符串开启了加增益时说一句台词。此项保持关闭，因为它会对其他玩家说话：如有需要，请在“我说什么”标签页中开启。"
L["What you say when you buff, and where, is kept as you had it, because you have speaking switched on."] = "加增益时说什么、在哪里说，都保持你原来的设置，因为你已开启发言。"
L["The prompt's look changes when this fight ends."] = "提示框的外观将在本场战斗结束后改变。"
L["|cffffd100/manners import undo|r puts your old settings back."] = "输入|cffffd100/manners import undo|r可恢复你原来的设置。"
L["nothing to undo -- no settings have been imported on this profile this session."] = "没有可撤销的内容——本次会话中此配置文件没有导入过设置。"
L["nothing to undo on this profile -- the last import was made on profile %s. Switch back to it to undo it."] = "此配置文件没有可撤销的内容——上次导入是在配置文件%s上进行的。切换回该配置文件即可撤销。"
L["nothing to undo on this profile -- the last import was made on another one. Switch back to it to undo it."] = "此配置文件没有可撤销的内容——上次导入是在另一个配置文件上进行的。切换回该配置文件即可撤销。"
L["your settings from before the import could not be read back, so they were not restored."] = "无法读回导入前的设置，所以未能恢复。"
L["your settings from before the import are back. The prompt's look changes when this fight ends."] = "导入前的设置已恢复。提示框的外观将在本场战斗结束后改变。"
L["your settings from before the import are back."] = "导入前的设置已恢复。"
