L["For a minute, offer your buff to someone who asks for it (\"fort pls\"); off by default because chat is guesswork."] = "有人向你要增益时（如“fort pls”），在一分钟内向其推荐你的增益；默认关闭，因为从聊天内容判断只能靠猜。"
L["Myself"] = "我自己"
L["Offer your own buffs to you when one is not up: the ones below. They are cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "当你自己的增益不在身上时推荐给你：即下面这些。它们会直接对你施放，然后恢复你原来的目标，也不说任何话。"
L["Offer your own buffs to you too, when one is not up: the ones below, and the buff you give others. They are cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "当你自己的增益不在身上时，也推荐给你：即下面这些，以及你给别人加的增益。它们会直接对你施放，然后恢复你原来的目标，也不说任何话。"
L["Offer your own buff to you too, when you are missing it or, with top-ups on, it is running low. It is cast on you, your target is handed back, and nothing is said."] = "当你缺少自己的增益时（或开启补加后快到期时），也推荐给你。它会直接对你施放，然后恢复你原来的目标，也不说任何话。"
L["Off: nothing is offered to you while the game calls you resting, in a city or an inn."] = "关闭：游戏显示你处于休息状态（在城市或旅店中）时，不会向你推荐任何增益。"
L["My group and raid"] = "我的队伍和团队"
L["Use group buffs"] = "使用群体增益"
L["When this many need it"] = "需要的人数达到"
L["Raid groups I buff"] = "我加增益的团队小队"
L["In a raid, only these groups are offered your buff; people who buff you or ask are offered anyway."] = "在团队中，只向这些小队推荐你的增益；给你加增益或向你要增益的人照样会被推荐。"
L["Who comes first"] = "谁优先"
L["My target first"] = "我的目标优先"
L["Your target goes ahead of everyone when the game can see they lack the buff."] = "当游戏能看到你的目标缺少该增益时，你的目标排在所有人前面。"
L["Greyed out while |cffffd100Always offer|r is chosen on %s: nothing is read then."] = "在“%s”中选择|cffffd100总是推荐|r时此项变灰：那时不会读取任何信息。"
L["Friends and guildmates first"] = "好友和公会成员优先"
L["Only changes the order; nobody is added or left out."] = "只改变先后顺序；不会增加或排除任何人。"
L["My group first at a ready check"] = "就位确认时我的队伍优先"
L["From a ready check until the pull, group members missing your buff go first."] = "从就位确认到开怪，缺少你增益的队友优先。"
L["Group members just revived first"] = "刚复活的队友优先"
L["For two minutes after someone is brought back, they go first if they lack your buff."] = "有人复活后的两分钟内，如果他缺少你的增益，就会优先。"
L["Who to skip"] = "跳过谁"
L["Skip players below level"] = "跳过低于此等级的玩家"
L["Someone known only by name is offered anyway."] = "只知道名字的人照样会被推荐。"
L["Skip players out of range"] = "跳过超出范围的玩家"
L["If the game cannot tell the range they are still offered."] = "如果游戏无法判断距离，仍会推荐对方。"
L["Skip players flagged for PvP"] = "跳过处于PvP状态的玩家"
L["Buffing somebody flagged for PvP flags you too. Ignored while you are flagged yourself, as in a battleground, but not while your own flag is running out."] = "给处于PvP状态的人加增益，你也会进入PvP状态。你自己处于PvP状态时（例如在战场中）此选项不生效，但在你自己的PvP状态即将结束时仍然生效。"
L["Skip my own class when they can cast it too"] = "跳过能自己施放的同职业玩家"
L["Somebody of your class can give themselves your buff, so they are left out -- unless they are too low a level for the rank you cast, and then they still get yours. People who buffed you, asked or you targeted are always offered."] = "同职业的玩家能自己给自己施放你的增益，所以会被跳过——除非其等级还学不到你施放的等级，这时仍会得到你的。为你施放过增益、提出请求或被你选为目标的人总会被提供。"
L["Never offer"] = "永不推荐"
L["Nobody is on the list. Shift-right-click the prompt to add the person it shows, or type a name below."] = "名单上还没有人。Shift+右键点击提示框可加入它显示的人，或在下方输入名字。"
L["One person is on the list. They are never offered anything as a passer-by or as a member of your group."] = "名单上有1个人。无论作为路人还是你的队友，都不会给他推荐任何增益。"
L["%d people are on the list. They are never offered anything as passers-by or as members of your group."] = "名单上有%d个人。无论作为路人还是你的队友，都不会给他们推荐任何增益。"
L["Somebody on it who buffs you is still offered the favour back. Shift-right-click them on the prompt to let that favour go."] = "名单上的人给你加增益时，仍会推荐你还人情。在提示框上Shift+右键点击他们即可勾销这份人情。"
L["Add a name"] = "添加名字"
L["Type it as the prompt shows it and press Enter."] = "按提示框上显示的写法输入，然后按回车键。"
L["Pick a name"] = "选择名字"
L["Remove from list"] = "移出名单"
L["Clear the list"] = "清空名单"
L["Take everybody off the never-offer list?"] = "将所有人移出永不推荐名单？"
L["Already buffed"] = "已有增益"
L["If they already have it"] = "如果对方已有该增益"
L["Your own buffs are offered when none is up; with Offer a top-up when it runs low, also when one is running out (never an aura or an aspect)."] = "你自己的增益一个都不在身上时会被推荐；选择“快到期时推荐补加”后，快到期时也会推荐（光环和守护除外）。"
L["Someone who buffed you is always offered a buff back; Diagnostics shows which buffs Manners can see on others."] = "给你加过增益的人总会被推荐回加；“诊断”标签页会显示Manners能在别人身上看到哪些增益。"
L["Skip them (default)"] = "跳过（默认）"
L["Offer a top-up when it runs low"] = "快到期时推荐补加"
L["Always offer (costs a lot of mana)"] = "总是推荐（耗费大量法力值）"
L["Top up when less than this is left (minutes)"] = "剩余时间低于此值时补加（分钟）"
L["Someone whose time left cannot be read is not offered a top-up, unless they buffed you."] = "无法读取剩余时间的人不会被推荐补加，除非对方给你加过增益。"
L["Everyone you offer to is offered again and again, even with a fresh buff."] = "你推荐的每个人都会被反复推荐，即使对方的增益刚刚加上。"
L["%s does nothing in this mode."] = "此模式下%s无效。"
L["Hold back"] = "暂缓推荐"
L["Casting would dismount you; it is always hidden while dead, on a flight path or in a vehicle."] = "施法会让你下坐骑；死亡、乘坐飞行路线或在载具中时，提示框总是隐藏。"
L["Below this, only your own buff and people who buffed you or asked are offered."] = "低于此值时，只推荐你自己的增益，以及给你加过增益或向你要过增益的人。"
L["Below this, only people who buffed you or asked are offered."] = "低于此值时，只推荐给你加过增益或向你要过增益的人。"
L["Off: buffs are offered at any mana."] = "关闭：无论法力值多少都会推荐增益。"
L["Below %d%% only favours, requests and your own buff are offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "低于%d%%时只推荐还人情、响应请求和你自己的增益；法力值回到%d%%时恢复推荐其他人。"
L["Below %d%% only favours and requests are offered; the rest come back at %d%%."] = "低于%d%%时只推荐还人情和响应请求；法力值回到%d%%时恢复推荐其他人。"
L["Offer a buff back for (seconds)"] = "回加时限（秒）"
L["Fantasy (general)"] = "奇幻（通用）"
L["loaded the %s lines."] = "已载入“%s”台词组。"
L["In combat: changes here apply once the fight ends."] = "战斗中：这里的更改在战斗结束后生效。"
L["Thanks and speech"] = "道谢和发言"
L["/thank people who buff me"] = "对给我加增益的人/thank"
L["Everyone near you sees it; never in combat or instances, and at most once per person every five minutes."] = "附近的人都能看到；战斗中和副本中不会使用，每人每5分钟最多一次。"
L["Say a line when I buff someone"] = "我给人加增益时说一句台词"
L["Where to say it"] = "在哪里说"
L["Whisper them sends it only to the person you buff."] = "“密语对方”只发给你加增益的那个人。"
L["Say"] = "说"
L["Whisper them"] = "密语对方"
L["Emote"] = "表情"
L["Party"] = "小队"
L["Raid"] = "团队"
L["Yell"] = "大喊"
L["Tick Say a line to choose what you say."] = "勾选“说一句台词”后即可选择要说的话。"
L["Lines"] = "台词"
L["Line set"] = "台词组"
L["Replaces the lines below."] = "替换下方的台词。"
L["Replace everything in the box below with the %s lines?"] = "用“%s”台词组替换下方文本框中的全部内容？"
L["One line is picked at random. Placeholders: {name} their name, {buff} the spell."] = "每次随机挑选一句。占位符：{name}为对方的名字，{buff}为法术。"
L["A line too long for a macro is skipped; Try a few shows what would go out."] = "宏放不下的过长台词会被跳过；“试几句台词”可以看到会发出什么。"
L["In character picks one of its %d lines when you click, to fit your race, faction, class and the moment. The box below shows only a few examples; editing it turns In character off."] = "“入戏”会在你点击时从%d句台词中挑选一句，贴合你的种族、阵营、职业和当时的情形。下方只列出几句示例；编辑它会关闭“入戏”。"
L["Your lines (one per line)"] = "你的台词（每行一句）"
L["Editing these turns In character off and uses only your lines. Continue?"] = "编辑这些台词会关闭“入戏”，只使用你自己的台词。继续吗？"
L["Go back to In character"] = "切回入戏"
L["Try a few lines"] = "试几句台词"
L["Prints sample lines in your chat; only you see them."] = "在聊天框中显示几句示例台词；只有你能看到。"
L["Somebody"] = "某人"
L["A line goes out when you click, even if the cast then fails out of range or line of sight."] = "台词在你点击时就会发出，即使随后因超出范围或不在视野内而施法失败。"
L["In combat: changes here show once the fight ends."] = "战斗中：这里的更改在战斗结束后显示。"
L["Dragging the prompt afterwards sets this to Where I dragged it."] = "之后拖动提示框，此项会变为“我拖到的位置”。"
L["Exact position"] = "精确位置"
L["Size"] = "大小"
L["Scale"] = "缩放"
L["Opacity"] = "不透明度"
L["Width"] = "宽度"
L["Height"] = "高度"
L["Style"] = "样式"
L["Panel style"] = "面板样式"
L["Panel colour"] = "面板颜色"
L["Colour marker by reason"] = "按原因为标记着色"
L["Pale yellow for your own target, orange for a favour owed, deep pink for somebody who asked, sky blue for your group, violet for passers-by -- the order they are offered in."] = "浅黄色表示你自己的目标，橙色表示待还的人情，深粉色表示向你要增益的人，天蓝色表示你的队友，紫色表示路人——也就是他们被推荐的先后顺序。"
L["Pale blue for your own target, amber for a favour owed, pink for somebody who asked, deeper blue for your group, grey for passers-by -- the order they are offered in."] = "浅蓝色表示你自己的目标，琥珀色表示待还的人情，粉色表示向你要增益的人，较深的蓝色表示你的队友，灰色表示路人——也就是他们被推荐的先后顺序。"
L["A colour that shows why this person is on the prompt."] = "用颜色表示此人为什么出现在提示框上。"
L["Reason colours"] = "原因颜色"
L["The colour-blind set keeps the reasons apart for red-green colour blindness, in colours that differ in lightness too."] = "“色盲友好”配色让红绿色盲也能分清各种原因，所用颜色的明暗也各不相同。"
L["Standard"] = "标准"
L["Colour-blind friendly"] = "色盲友好"
L["Marker colour"] = "标记颜色"
L["Used when Colour marker by reason is off."] = "“按原因为标记着色”关闭时使用。"
