L["There is nothing left to colour: rounding the icon off replaces the ring with a mask, and the framed look has no stripe."] = "没有可着色的地方了：将图标裁成圆形会用遮罩取代外圈，“带框”外观也没有色条。"
L["There is nothing left to colour: the ring is drawn behind the icon, which is switched off."] = "没有可着色的地方了：外圈画在图标后面，而图标已关闭。"
L["There is nothing left to colour: rounding the icon off replaces the ring with a mask."] = "没有可着色的地方了：将图标裁成圆形会用遮罩取代外圈。"
L["There is nothing left to colour: the framed look has no stripe."] = "没有可着色的地方了：“带框”外观没有色条。"
L["Getting my attention"] = "提醒我"
L["Flash when someone buffs me"] = "有人给我加增益时闪烁"
L["Needs the icon, the stripe or Full animations."] = "需要显示图标、色条，或将动画设为“完整”。"
L["Pulse until I buff them back"] = "持续脉动，直到我回加增益"
L["Flash once"] = "闪烁一次"
