L["Round the icon off"] = "将图标裁成圆形"
L["Masks the icon into a circle. Reads more like a portrait than a spell, so it is off by default."] = "用遮罩把图标裁成圆形。看起来更像头像而不是法术，所以默认关闭。"
L["Show the global cooldown on the icon"] = "在图标上显示公共冷却时间"
L["Sweeps the spell icon while the global cooldown runs, like your action bars, so you can see when the next press will go through."] = "公共冷却期间，法术图标上会像动作条一样显示冷却动画，让你知道下一次按键何时能生效。"
L["Not in a fight while this is on:"] = "开启下面这项时，战斗中不显示："
