L["List the next few below"] = "在下方列出接下来的几人"
L["How many to list"] = "列出几人"
L["The defaults suit most players; change these only if something bothers you."] = "默认设置适合大多数玩家；只有觉得哪里不对劲时才需要更改。"
L["In combat: targeting changes apply once the fight ends."] = "战斗中：与选择目标有关的更改在战斗结束后生效。"
L["Put these back to default"] = "恢复本页默认设置"
L["Ignore shields, heals and trinket procs"] = "忽略护盾、治疗和饰品触发效果"
